Alembic migrations for the app/ auth schema.

The database URL comes from app.core.configs.config.settings
(sqlalchemy_database_uri), not from alembic.ini — set DATABASE_URL or the
POSTGRES_* variables in your env file.

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the change"
    alembic upgrade head
    alembic downgrade -1

Always read a generated revision before applying it. An empty upgrade() usually
means a new model was not imported in app/models/__init__.py.
